# Functions allowed to write a subscription's facts: <path>::<impl type>::<fn>, or
# <path>::* for a whole module | class | reason. Classes: see check-fact-writers.sh.
# Keep it short and current: an entry whose function no longer writes a fact fails the check.
# The aim is services::facts and its primitives alone (design/phase-7-facts.md).

# Primitives: the diesel-models functions writing the fact tables. Their callers are checked.
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::SubscriptionPlanWindowRow::open_replacing | primitive | opens a plan window, closing or replacing the open one, and returns the one it replaced
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::SubscriptionPlanWindowRow::insert_batch | primitive | first plan windows of inserted subscriptions
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::SubscriptionPlanWindowRow::set_origin | primitive | a window's cadence origin decided after the migration
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::record_window_origin | primitive | the origin a renewal records late on the switch opening a window
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::SubscriptionTrialRow::insert_batch | primitive | trials of inserted subscriptions
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::SubscriptionTrialRow::end_by | primitive | a plan change ends the trial on its date
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::SubscriptionStartSettledRow::insert_batch | primitive | settled starts, the first one kept
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::SubscriptionEndingRow::insert_batch | primitive | endings: a fixed term at insert
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::SubscriptionEndingRow::withdraw_cancellation | primitive | a cancellation withdrawn with its events
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::record_scheduled_facts | primitive | a scheduled cancellation's ending, recorded with its event
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_facts.rs::ScheduledRows::withdraw | primitive | withdraws what a scheduled change wrote dated its day (its window, the window it replaced, minimum, trial cut) when it is cancelled before it applies
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_adjustments.rs::SubscriptionAdjustmentRow::end_current | primitive | closes the open minimum on a date, dropping later ones
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_adjustments.rs::SubscriptionAdjustmentRowNew::insert | primitive | one dated minimum
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_adjustments.rs::SubscriptionAdjustmentRowNew::insert_batch | primitive | dated minimums of inserted subscriptions
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_adjustments.rs::SubscriptionAdjustmentComponentRow::insert_batch | primitive | the products a dated minimum is scoped to
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/applied_coupons.rs::AppliedCouponRowNew::insert | primitive | one applied coupon, its effective_from with it
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/applied_coupons.rs::AppliedCouponRow::insert_batch | primitive | applied coupons, each with its effective_from

# The facts module: the writers that stay.
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/facts.rs::* | writer | records each fact when its path decides it (insert, settled start, plan and cadence changes, origins)
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/facts/pending.rs::* | writer | writes a scheduled change as the future rows it resolves to (at once, or a pending one migrated), and withdraws them when it is cancelled

# Scheduled events record or withdraw the facts they decide, in the same transaction.
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/scheduled_events.rs::ScheduledEventRowNew::insert_batch | writer | a scheduled cancellation records its ending with its event
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/scheduled_events.rs::ScheduledEventRow::cancel_event | writer | cancelling a cancellation event withdraws its ending
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/scheduled_events.rs::ScheduledEventRow::cancel_pending_lifecycle_events | writer | cancelling a subscription's pending lifecycle events withdraws its cancellation
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/scheduled_events.rs::ScheduledEventRow::cancel_pending_subscription_events | writer | same, for every pending event of the subscription
modules/meteroid/crates/diesel-models/src/query/subscription_events.rs::SubscriptionEventRow::record_cadence_origin | writer | a renewal recording a switch's origin late records its window's too

# Minimums: dated rows, written where the minimum is set.
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/domain/subscription_minimums.rs::SubscriptionMinimumNew::to_row | writer | builds the dated minimum row its callers insert (minimum.rs, plan_change.rs)
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/subscriptions/minimum.rs::Services::replace_subscription_minimum | writer | an operator's minimum: closes the open one today, opens the new one
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/subscriptions/plan_change.rs::refresh_subscription_minimum_on_plan_change | writer | a plan change dates the new plan's minimum from its date
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/subscriptions/insert/process.rs::Services::persist_subscriptions_internal | writer | a new subscription's first minimum and its scopes, from its start

# Coupons: an applied_coupon row carries its effective_from from the insert.
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/subscriptions/utils.rs::process_create_subscription_coupons | writer | coupons of a new subscription, from its start date
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/subscriptions/utils.rs::record_coupon_redemptions | writer | inserts the applied coupons every coupon path builds
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/credit/coupon_grant.rs::redeem_coupon_credit_code_tx | writer | a promotional credit code redeemed on a subscription, from the redemption's date
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/credit/coupon_grant.rs::mint_started_subscription_coupon_credit_tx | writer | copies the applied coupons to fund their credit; inserts none
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/edge.rs::ServicesEdge::complete_subscription_checkout_charging_tx | writer | a coupon code entered at checkout, from the checkout's date
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/orchestration/payment_transaction_settled.rs::apply_priced_coupons_tx | writer | coupons a checkout priced but had not applied, applied when its payment settles
